extends layout.pug

block title
  | You’re on the Alliance waitlist

block content
  p You’re on the waitlist! We’ll email you when the project launches.
  p Invite others to join with your personal link:
  p
    a(href=url)= url
  +button(ownUrl, "Invite others")
  p.fine-print If you didn’t join the waitlist, you can ignore this email.
  include waitlist-unsubscribe.pug
